| ========================================================== |
| Test: web.domain and print escape sequences |
| ========================================================== |
**Import**($Website)@also%~web!`global`:web

| ========================================================== |
| Test: <print> with x"\n" escape |
| ========================================================== |
[
    | <print>string^(x"\n") - trailing string escape |
    <print>string^(x"\n")

    | <print>string^("Test with newline\n") |
    <print>string^("Test with newline\n")

    | <print> with x"\n" after content |
    <print>string^(x"\n")
]
